{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47026","headline":"观李琼处士画海涛 · 齐己","name":"观李琼处士画海涛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨鳌转侧长鰌翻，狂涛颠浪高漫漫。\n李琼夺得造化本，都卢缩在秋毫端。\n一挥一画皆筋骨，滉漾崩腾大鲸臬。\n叶扑仙槎摆欲沉，下头应是骊龙窟。\n昔年曾要涉蓬瀛，唯闻撼动珊瑚声。\n今来正叹陆沉久，见君此画思前程。\n千寻万派功难测，海门山小涛头白。\n令人错认钱塘城，罗刹石底奔雷霆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}